      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Community Healer",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When Treating Disease or Treating Wounds, the humanitarian healer can treat up to eight targets. In addition, each time the peerless healer successfully Treats Wounds, they can also either reduce the value of one Clumsy, Enfeebled, Drained, or Stupefied condition affecting a single patient by 2 or cast a 7th-rank Clear Mind, Sound Body, or Sure Footing spell on one patient without expending a spell slot."
    },
